   "text": "Deferred labels travel with the question\n- off_topic: OUT_OF_SCOPE only if\n  the gate refuses\n- legal_medical, personal_data,\n  action_request: disclaimer after\n  generation\n- abuse_with_question, about_source:\n  answered as ordinary questions\n- harmful: rules decide, the\n  classifier alone never blocks",
